272
00:37:18,035 --> 00:37:20,989
That's a glyph...
a vampire cattle brand.

273
00:37:21,413 --> 00:37:24,118
It means that Officer Krieger
is somebody's property.

274
00:37:24,541 --> 00:37:26,607
Another vampire tries
to bleed this little hooker...

275
00:37:26,707 --> 00:37:29,124
