It's a blood bank.

288
00:38:07,501 --> 00:38:09,436
Owned by vampires,
and there's one in every city.

289
00:38:09,536 --> 00:38:11,335
And they always deliver.

290
00:38:11,755 --> 00:38:13,130
So, where were you taking it?

291
00:38:13,549 --> 00:38:14,949
I don't know
what you're talking...

292
00:38:16,468 --> 00:38:18,377
Look, take it easy.

293
00:38:18,804 --> 00:38:20,547
I'm only going to ask you
one more time.

294
00:38:20,973 --> 00:38:23,214
Where were you taking it?

295
00:38:23,642 --> 00:38:24,642
Go fuck yourself.

296
00:38:25,018 --> 00:38:26,394
Fuck me? No, you fuck this.

297
00:38:44,580 --> 00:38:46,122
You better wake up.

298
00:38:46,540 --> 00:38:49,327
The world you live in
is just a sugar-coated topping.

299
00:38:49,751 --> 00:38:51,874
There is another world
beneath it...

300
00:38:52,296 --> 00:38:53,296
the real world.

301
00:38:53,505 --> 00:38:57,717
If you want to survive it,
learn to pull the trigger.

302
00:39:01,638 --> 00:39:03,132
Wait a minute.
I'm coming with you.

303
00:39:03,557 --> 00:39:04,719
You're useless.

304
