with Blade.

316
00:40:13,919 --> 00:40:16,492
I got to clear out
that clinic on Hillbarn now!

317
00:40:37,234 --> 00:40:39,559
Looks like we hit pay dirt.

318
00:40:39,987 --> 00:40:41,529
