We're like brothers.

372
00:46:08,649 --> 00:46:09,680
Fuck.

373
00:46:10,108 --> 00:46:11,306
Fuck. Frost.

374
00:46:15,364 --> 00:46:17,204
I've been telling these bitches
all about you.

375
00:46:17,616 --> 00:46:19,696
They've been dying to meet you.
They are so psyched.

376
00:46:19,952 --> 00:46:21,944
Bad ass bitches. They...

377
00:46:23,956 --> 00:46:26,114
Frost, it's about Blade.

378
00:46:26,542 --> 00:46:27,542
He's busy, you know?

379
00:46:27,834 --> 00:46:29,792
Because when he's focused
on business...

380
00:46:30,921 --> 00:46:32,332
Frost, this is important.

381
00:46:32,756 --> 00:46:34,381
Blade was waiting for me...

382
