385
00:46:41,848 --> 00:46:44,174
It was a trap, see?
But don’t worry about it.

386
00:46:44,601 --> 00:46:46,677
It's no problem.
We can still get the girl.

387
00:47:18,468 --> 00:47:19,548
Forget the girl.

388
00:47:19,970 --> 00:47:22,461
- I want Blade.
- I know you do.

389
00:47:22,890 --> 00:47:25,677
