420
00:49:19,464 --> 00:49:21,208
Is that so?

421
00:49:22,467 --> 00:49:24,045
Well, that's what Frost says.

422
00:49:24,469 --> 00:49:27,221
Then you won't mind me
borrowing this, will you?

423
00:49:27,639 --> 00:49:30,510
If he moves, fry him.

424
00:49:33,812 --> 00:49:34,804
