438
00:52:07,883 --> 00:52:09,081
Give it to him!

439
00:52:27,194 --> 00:52:28,356
Nice one.

440
00:52:29,446 --> 00:52:30,609
Well, well, well.

441
00:52:31,490 --> 00:52:32,490
You took my arm, man.

442
00:52:32,908 --> 00:52:34,450
