445
00:52:40,332 --> 00:52:42,490
Think I'll ever
play piano again?

446
00:52:44,253 --> 00:52:45,913
You can slice him,
you can dice him...

447
00:52:46,338 --> 00:52:47,998
but the Quinn man
just keeps on comin'!

448
00:52:48,423 --> 00:52:49,423
Check it out.

449
00:52:49,591 --> 00:52:51,833
I've got his pigsticker.

450
00:52:56,181 --> 00:52:57,592
You're a fuckup, Crease!

451
00:53:03,689 --> 00:53:06,476
You're just full of surprises,
ain't you, chief?

452
00:53:14,950 --> 00:53:17,523
Stay with me, sweetness...

453
00:53:17,953 --> 00:53:20,361
