with you yet.

454
00:53:22,583 --> 00:53:24,374
Looky here.

455
00:53:26,628 --> 00:53:27,909
Silver.

456
00:53:28,338 --> 00:53:29,583
Nice craftsmanship, huh?

457
00:53:30,007 --> 00:53:31,631
