474
00:55:02,724 --> 00:55:04,644
Think I'd let him run loose
without a chaperone?

475
00:55:13,443 --> 00:55:15,235
Christ! I'm too old for this.

476
00:55:16,530 --> 00:55:18,736
Somebody get me
a goddamn wheelchair.

477
00:55:29,501 --> 00:55:30,621
He can take care of himself.

478
00:55:30,836 --> 00:55:32,034
Jump!

479
00:56:53,585 --> 00:56:54,585
What are you gonna do?

480
00:56:55,712 --> 00:56:57,123
Oh, my God.

481
00:57:12,604 --> 00:57:13,604
