487
00:57:58,275 --> 00:57:59,650
I'm something else.

488
00:58:07,326 --> 00:58:08,903
I found him when he was 13.

489
00:58:09,328 --> 00:58:10,870
He'd been livin'
on the streets...

490
00:58:11,288 --> 00:58:12,830
feedin' off the homeless.

491
00:58:14,291 --> 00:58:16,864
His need for blood
had taken hold at puberty.

492
00:58:17,294 --> 00:58:20,295
I took him for a vampire
at first.

493
00:58:21,298 --> 00:58:22,757
Almost killed him, too.

494
00:58:23,967 --> 00:58:25,960
Then I realized what he was.

495
00:58:27,262 --> 00:58:28,982
Blade's mother
was attacked by a vampire...

496
00:58:29,348 --> 00:58:30,806
while she was pregnant.

497
00:58:31,225 --> 00:58:33,929
She died, but he lived.

498
00:58:34,353 --> 00:58:37,638
Unfortunately, he'd undergone
certain genetic changes.

499
00:58:38,065 --> 00:58:41,647
He can withstand garlic,
silver...

500
00:58:42,069 --> 00:58:43,231
even sunlight...

501
00:58:43,654 --> 00:58:45,362
and he's got their strength.

502
00:58:47,366 --> 00:58:50,320
This time tomorrow,
all his wounds will be healed.

503
00:58:52,287 --> 00:58:54,410
He still ages like a human,
though.

504
00:58:54,831 --> 00:58:57,369
Vampires age slower than us.

505
00:58:58,669 --> 00:59:00,626
Unfortunately...

506
00:59:01,046 --> 00:59:03,086
