518
00:59:45,382 --> 00:59:47,125
which order they’d die in.

519
00:59:50,721 --> 00:59:53,675
We kill as many of 'em
as we can find...

520
00:59:54,099 --> 00:59:55,297
but it's gettin' worse.

521
00:59:55,726 --> 00:59:56,971
Because of Frost.

522
00:59:57,394 --> 01:00:00,478
